cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "gs-dft: Scaling Density Functional Theory with Gaussian Splatting"
abstract: >-
  Kohn-Sham DFT in a trainable basis of floating anisotropic Gaussians, optimized
  jointly with the orbitals by gradient descent, with adaptive density fitting,
  screening and multi-GPU sharding, in JAX.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/andresguzco/gs-dft"
keywords:
  - density functional theory
  - Gaussian splatting
  - quantum chemistry
  - JAX
